        "TileImage": "$($repository ae772962-0a69-43c8-bad1-fce43566d1da).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon Agent 47.\rYour targets are two service workers employed in the private islets of the resort. These two were former employees of our clients, who did not it well that they left their service. Eliminate them quickly and quietly.\rOne more thing, agent. Our clients are, as one might say, &quot;hoity-toity,&quot; so they have asked for this mission to be performed while maintaining a certain level of style.\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
